# AWS Lambda with Terraform

## Overview

Creates and deploys an AWS Lambda function using Terraform with:

- IAM execution role
- Python 3.14 Lambda function
- ZIP deployment package
- Environment variables
- Lambda Function URL

## Architecture

```text
              Terraform
                  │
        ┌─────────┴─────────┐
        ▼                   ▼
    IAM Role          Lambda Function
                            │
                            ▼
                    Lambda Function URL

IAM Role
lambda_execution_role
Lambda Function URL
Authorization: AWS_IAM
Invoke mode: RESPONSE_STREAM
CORS: Enabled

The Function URL can invoke Lambda directly without API Gateway.

Environment Variables 
Environment variables allows to pass configuration values to your Lambda without hardcoding them in the Python code.
ENVIRONMENT = production
LOG_LEVEL   = info

Status
✅ Lambda deployed with Terraform
✅ IAM execution role configured
✅ ZIP deployment working
✅ Function URL configured
